To use the Virtual Fly Brain Model Context Protocol (MCP) tool, follow these steps: Open Claude Desktop, go to Settings, navigate to the MCP section, and add a new MCP server with the specified settings. Alternatively, use the Configuration JSON method or set up the tool with GitHub Copilot or VS Code.

The specified settings are:
Server Name: virtual-fly-brain (or any name you prefer)
Type: HTTP
Server URL: https://vfb3-mcp.virtualflybrain.org

For the Configuration JSON method, use the following:
```
{
"mcpServers": {
"virtual-fly-brain": {
"type": "http",
"url": "https://vfb3-mcp.virtualflybrain.org",
"tools": ["*"]
}
}
}
```
